  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal of the programme Support to Syria and Syria&apos;s neighbourhood (3SN) - Lebanon and Jordan 2024-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme is a continuation of Denmark&#x2019;s support to the response to the Syrian displacement crisis in the region. It has a thematic focus on protection and livelihoods, and seeks wo work across the HDP nexus for the benefit of refugees, internally displaced persons and affected host communities in and around Syria, namely in Jordan and Lebanon.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To undertake quality assurance of the proposed 3SN programme  and provide recommendations for the finalisation of the 3SN programme document and its underlying project documents.</narrative>
  </description>
